To renew your contract with VSP and ensure continuous service, please have the appropriate representative review
this information, select the desired renewal action, sign and return this Renewal Agreement to the email address
below. VSP produces your Plan Policy upon receipt of your confirmation of renewal. Your new Plan Policy may
contain some provisions that are changed from those in your current Policy, so you should review the new Policy
carefully upon receipt. Please file this Agreement with your VSP contract as it serves as your notice of renewal.
